      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(c) The membership of the Planning Council shall include representatives of health care providers, community-based and AIDS service organizations, social service providers, mental health care providers, local public health agencies, hospital planning agencies or health care planning agencies, affected communities (including individuals with HIV/AIDS), non-elected community leaders, State government, grantees of categorical grants for early intervention services under subpart II of part C of the Ryan White Act and the lead agency of any Health Resources and Services Administration adult and pediatric HIV-related care demonstration project operating in the area to be served. At least one member of the Planning Council shall represent separately each of these specified categories.",
